                                "summary":  "In volume 41 of My Hero Academia, Izuku Midoriya and his classmates of Class 1-A face escalating threats from powerful villains. As battles intensify, Deku deepens his mastery over One For All while understanding the severe burdens of being a symbol of peace. Together with his allies, they confront complex moral dilemmas, proving that courage is an active choice made in the darkest times.",
